e,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": true,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 2,\r\n      \"query_count\": 128,\r\n      \"selected_seed_object\": 15,\r\n      \"oracle_seed_object\": 15\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene_index\": 0,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.7666395902633667,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.7721088528633118,\r\n      \"positive_oracle_iou\": 0.7666395902633667,\r\n      \"negative_oracle_iou\": 0.7721088528633118,\r\n      \"positive_selected_iou\": 0.7666395902633667,\r\n      \"selected_positive\": true,\r\n      \"oracle_positive\": false,\r\n      \"positive_count\": 6,\r\n{\r\n  \"scenes\": 64,\r\n  \"expressions\": 1660,\r\n  \"material_errors\": 387,\r\n  \"repeat_mismatch\": 30,\r\n  \"oracle_higher_support\": 287,\r\n  \"oracle_higher_null\": 198,\r\n  \"oracle_higher_plain\": 102,\r\n  \"indicator_miou\": 0.822538555763572,\r\n  \"support_only_miou\": 0.7801883359731411,\r\n  \"product_miou\": 0.7961198287331556,\r\n  \"null_product_miou\": 0.7281635735537408,\r\n  \"plain_product_miou\": 0.798385920308261,\r\n  \"product_flips\": 650,\r\n  \"null_product_flips\": 974,\r\n  \"plain_product_flips\": 687,\r\n  \"peak_reserved_gib\": 3.4765625,\r\n  \"rows\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"scene\": 0,\r\n      \"selected\": 66,\r\n      \"oracle\": 45,\r\n      \"selected_iou\": 0.7841115593910217,\r\n      \"oracle_iou\": 0.8817465305328369,\r\n      \"selected_support\": 0.3867494463920593,\r\n      \"oracle_support\": 0.43524083495140076,\r\n      \"selected_null\": 0.0690055638551712,\r\n      \"oracle_null\": 0.06559990346431732,\r\n      \"selected_plain\": 0.06848236918449402,\r\n      \"oracle_plain\": 0.0672130212187767,\r\n      \"support_iou\": 0.7679814100265503,\r\n      \"product_iou\": 0.8029108643531799,\r\n      \"null_product_iou\": 0.7841115593910217,\r\n      \"plain_product_iou\": 0.7841115593910217,\r\n      \"product_flip\": true,\r\n================================================================================\n  Research Pipeline Report - AdaRES_project\n  2026-09-26 22:05 Asia/Shanghai (design tick)\n================================================================================\n\n## 0. Goal Status\n| Target | Champion | Gap | Phase |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ScanRefer mIoU >= 0.5150 | AdaRES-B4-E30 0.5094 | +0.0056 | Phase 1 unmet; Phase 2 pending |\n\nB1 baseline 0.5020; champion gain +0.0074. Prepared monitor and goal checks succeeded once and were not rerun.\n\n## 1. GPU Overview\n| Server | GPU | Util | Memory Used | Assignment |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| server-2 | 0 | 0% before probes | 1 MiB before probes | no project task; R1/R2 probes completed |\n| server-2 | 1 | 0% before probes | 1 MiB before probes | no project task |\n\nTargeted GPU query preceded read-only probes; no post-probe utilization claim. Server-6 excluded.\n\n## 2. Running Experiments\n| ID | Config | Server | GPU | Epoch | Best mIoU | Acc@50 | spmIoU | No-Impr | Status |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| - | - | - | - | - | - | - | - | - | none |\n\n## 3. Queue Status\n| Position | ID | Config | Status | Depends On | Server |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| - | - | - | no waiting or claiming tasks | - | - |\n\nActive 0/2 target; candidate admission budget 2. No due research candidates. R1/R2 did not pass admission gates.\n\n## 4. This Tick's Actions\n- R1 fixed 64 training-scene native audit: 1660 expressions, 388 material selection errors. Selected/overall-oracle/positive-restricted-oracle mIoU 0.82256/0.91035/0.89203; oracle-positive filtering is not inference-valid. Final repeat mismatch 0. G1 metric-target route already completed below B4.\n- R2 independent peer-confidence audit with cyclic-null and plain-overlap controls: oracle support higher in 287/387 errors versus null 198/387; frozen product mIoU 0.79612 versus B4 0.82254, 650 selection flips and 30 strict repeat mismatches. Reject this propagation rule.\n- Stored read-only probe code and raw JSON, hashed diagnosis/review/design, and research ledger. No native backward, training-resource qualification, model/config package, admission receipt, code sync, dispatch or queue mutation. R2 inference peak 3.48 GiB is not training peak.\n- No pending questions in snapshot. Bounded routes exhausted this cycle, not a global hypothesis-exhaustion claim. Resume with independently justified inference-available mechanism and all six gates.\n\n## 5. Decisions Made\n- 2026-09-26 22:04 `route_change`: reject oracle-positive R1 and frozen peer-confidence R2; leave both server-2 slots unqueued. See `pipeline/decisions/20260926-220404_route_change.md`.\n\n================================================================================\n  Next tick: scheduled pipeline tick\n================================================================================\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\chuanle song\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Microsoft\\\\WindowsApps\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -LiteralPath 'AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_l1_feature_consistency.py' -TotalCount 180; Get-Content -LiteralPath 'AdaRES/tools/diagnose_adares_m1_seed_support.py' -TotalCount 120\"","aggregated_output":"import argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor():\r\n    def predict_by_feat(\r\n        self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n        gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp,\r\n    ):\r\n        valid = (~out[\"batch_mask\"]).float()\r\n        features = F.normalize(self.probe_scene, dim=-1)\r\n        weights = out[\"masks\"].sigmoid() * valid[:, None, :]\r\n        area = weights.sum(-1).clamp_min(1e-6)\r\n        centroid = torch.bmm(weights, features) / area[..., None]\r\n        # Unit feature vectors make the centroid norm a bounded coherence statistic.\r\n        coherence = centroid.norm(dim=-1)\r\n        hard = (out[\"masks\"] > 0).float() * valid[:, None, :]\r\n        hard_area = hard.sum(-1).clamp_min(1)\r\n        hard_coherence = (torch.bmm(hard, features) / hard_area[..., None]).norm(dim=-1)\r\n        boundary_scores = []\r\n        for batch_index in range(features.shape[0]):\r\n            count = int(valid[batch_index].sum())\r\n            coords = self.probe_positions[batch_index, :count]\r\n            feature = features[batch_index, :count]\r\n            distance = torch.cdist(coords, coords)\r\n            neighbors = distance.topk(min(9, count), largest=False).indices[:, 1:]\r\n            contrast = 1 - (feature[:, None, :] * feature[neighbors]).sum(-1)\r\n            membership = hard[batch_index, :, :count].bool()\r\n            neighbor_membership = membership[:, neighbors]\r\n            crossing = membership[:, :, None] != neighbor_membership\r\n            across = (crossing.float() * contrast).sum((1, 2)) / crossing.sum(\r\n                (1, 2)\r\n            ).clamp_min(1)\r\n            within = ((~crossing).float() * contrast).sum((1, 2)) / (\r\n                ~crossing\r\n            ).sum((1, 2)).clamp_min(1)\r\n            boundary_scores.append(across - within)\r\n        boundary = torch.stack(boundary_scores)\r\n        confidence = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"], dim=-1)[..., 1]\r\n        rows = []\r\n        for index, target in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n            masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n            truth = target.gt(0.5).to(masks.device)\r\n            ious = (masks & truth).sum(-1).float() / (\r\n                (masks | truth).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float()\r\n            )\r\n            selected = int(confidence[index].argmax())\r\n            oracle = int(ious.argmax())\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"scene_index\": self.probe_scene_index,\r\n                \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_coherence\": float(coherence[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_coherence\": float(coherence[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_hard_coherence\": float(hard_coherence[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_hard_coherence\": float(hard_coherence[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_area\": float(area[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_area\": float(area[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_boundary\": float(boundary[index, selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_boundary\": float(boundary[index, oracle]),\r\n                \"coherence_only_iou\": float(ious[coherence[index].argmax()]),\r\n                \"hard_coherence_only_iou\": float(ious[hard_coherence[index].argmax()]),\r\n                \"boundary_only_iou\": float(ious[boundary[index].argmax()]),\r\n            })\r\n        return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n    return predict_by_feat\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=1)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.val.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\",\r\n    }\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.eval()\r\n\r\n    def capture_scene(module, inputs, output):\r\n        model.probe_scene = output\r\n\r\n    def capture_positions(module, inputs):\r\n        model.probe_positions, _ = module.get_batches(inputs[5], inputs[2])\r\n\r\n    model.dec.register_forward_pre_hook(capture_positions)\r\n    model.dec.ila_ffn_layers[-1].register_forward_hook(capture_scene)\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor(), model)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        model.probe_scene_index = index\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            rows.extend(model(dataset.collate_fn([dataset[index]]), mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"])\r\n    errors = [r for r in rows if r[\"oracle_iou\"] - r[\"selected_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"checkpoint\": args.checkpoint,\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"material_errors\": len(errors),\r\n        \"oracle_more_coherent\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_coherence\"] > r[\"selected_coherence\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_more_hard_coherent\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_hard_coherence\"] > r[\"selected_hard_coherence\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"selected_coherence_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"selected_coherence\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_coherence_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"oracle_coherence\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"indicator_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"selected_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"coherence_only_miou\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"coherence_only_iou\"] for r in rows\r\n        ),\r\n        \"hard_coherence_only_miou\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"hard_coherence_only_iou\"] for r in rows\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_boundary_higher\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_boundary\"] > r[\"selected_boundary\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"selected_boundary_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"selected_boundary\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_boundary_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"oracle_boundary\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"boundary_only_miou\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"boundary_only_iou\"] for r in rows\r\n        ),\r\n        \"rows\": rows,\r\n    }\r\n    Path(args.output).write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n    print(json.dumps({k: v for k, v in result.items() if k != \"rows\"}))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\nimport argparse\r\nimport json\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nimport types\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nimport gorilla\r\nimport torch\r\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\r\n\r\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\r\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\r\n\r\nfrom ipdn.dataset import build_dataset\r\nfrom ipdn.model_paper5.adares_b4_query_competition import IPDN\r\nfrom ipdn.utils import get_root_logger\r\n\r\n\r\ndef predictor():\r\n    def predict_by_feat(\r\n        self, scan_ids, object_idss, ann_ids, out, superpoints,\r\n        gt_pmasks, gt_spmasks, fps_seed_sp,\r\n    ):\r\n        rows = []\r\n        for index, target in enumerate(gt_pmasks):\r\n            masks = out[\"masks\"][index].sigmoid().gt(0.5)[:, superpoints]\r\n            truth = target.gt(0.5).to(masks.device)\r\n            ious = (masks & truth).sum(-1).float() / (\r\n                (masks | truth).sum(-1).clamp_min(1).float()\r\n            )\r\n            seed_sp = fps_seed_sp[index].long()[out[\"sample_inds\"][index].long()]\r\n            query_index = torch.arange(seed_sp.numel(), device=seed_sp.device)\r\n            seed_support = out[\"masks\"][index, query_index, seed_sp].sigmoid()\r\n            confidence = F.softmax(out[\"indis\"][index], dim=-1)[:, 1]\r\n            selected = int(confidence.argmax())\r\n            oracle = int(ious.argmax())\r\n            rows.append({\r\n                \"scene_index\": self.probe_scene_index,\r\n                \"selected_iou\": float(ious[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_iou\": float(ious[oracle]),\r\n                \"selected_seed_support\": float(seed_support[selected]),\r\n                \"oracle_seed_support\": float(seed_support[oracle]),\r\n                \"seed_support_only_iou\": float(ious[seed_support.argmax()]),\r\n            })\r\n        return {\"rows\": rows}\r\n\r\n    return predict_by_feat\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main():\r\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"config\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"checkpoint\")\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\", required=True)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--scenes\", type=int, default=16)\r\n    parser.add_argument(\"--gpu-id\", type=int, default=1)\r\n    args = parser.parse_args()\r\n\r\n    gorilla.set_cuda_visible_devices([args.gpu_id], 1)\r\n    gorilla.set_random_seed(1999)\r\n    cfg = gorilla.Config.fromfile(args.config)\r\n    data_cfg = cfg.data.val.copy()\r\n    data_cfg.training = False\r\n    data_cfg.aug = False\r\n    data_cfg.with_elastic = False\r\n    data_cfg.lang_num_max = 32\r\n    dataset = build_dataset(data_cfg, get_root_logger())\r\n    model = IPDN(**cfg.model).cuda()\r\n    checkpoint = torch.load(args.checkpoint, map_location=\"cpu\")\r\n    loaded = model.load_state_dict(checkpoint.get(\"model\", checkpoint), strict=False)\r\n    allowed = {\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.position_ids\",\r\n        \"text_encoder.embeddings.token_type_ids\",\r\n    }\r\n    if loaded.missing_keys or set(loaded.unexpected_keys) - allowed:\r\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Checkpoint mismatch: {loaded}\")\r\n    model.eval()\r\n    model.predict_by_feat = types.MethodType(predictor(), model)\r\n    rows = []\r\n    for index in range(min(args.scenes, len(dataset))):\r\n        model.probe_scene_index = index\r\n        with torch.no_grad():\r\n            rows.extend(model(dataset.collate_fn([dataset[index]]), mode=\"predict\")[\"rows\"])\r\n    errors = [row for row in rows if row[\"oracle_iou\"] - row[\"selected_iou\"] > 0.05]\r\n    result = {\r\n        \"checkpoint\": args.checkpoint,\r\n        \"scenes\": min(args.scenes, len(dataset)),\r\n        \"expressions\": len(rows),\r\n        \"material_errors\": len(errors),\r\n        \"oracle_support_higher\": sum(\r\n            r[\"oracle_seed_support\"] > r[\"selected_seed_support\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"selected_support_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"selected_seed_support\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"oracle_support_mean\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"oracle_seed_support\"] for r in errors\r\n        ),\r\n        \"indicator_miou\": statistics.fmean(r[\"selected_iou\"] for r in rows),\r\n        \"seed_support_only_miou\": statistics.fmean(\r\n            r[\"seed_support_only_iou\"] for r in rows\r\n        ),\r\n        \"rows\": rows,\r\n    }\r\n    Path(args.output).write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\r\n    print(json.dumps({k: v for k, v in result.items() if k != \"rows\"}))\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
